1	Attention:
2	Copy A of this form is provided for informational purposes only. Copy A appears in red,
3	similar to the official IRS form. The official printed version of Copy A of this IRS form is
4	scannable, but the online version of it, printed from this website, is not. Do not print and file
5	copy A downloaded from this website; a penalty may be imposed for filing with the IRS
6	information return forms that can’t be scanned. See part O in the current General
7	Instructions for Certain Information Returns, available at IRS.gov/Form1099, for more
8	information about penalties.
9	Please note that Copy B and other copies of this form, which appear in black, may be
10	downloaded and printed and used to satisfy the requirement to provide the information to
11	the recipient.
12	If you have 10 or more information returns to file, you may be required to file e-file. Go to
13	IRS.gov/InfoReturn for e-file options.
14	If you have fewer than 10 information returns to file, we strongly encourage you to e-file. If
15	you want to file them on paper, you can place an order for the official IRS information
16	returns, which include a scannable Copy A for filing with the IRS and all other applicable
17	copies of the form, at IRS.gov/EmployerForms. We’ll mail you the forms you request and
18	their instructions, as well as any publications you may order.
19	See Publications 1141, 1167, and 1179 for more information about printing these forms.
